"— pick whichever fits your classroom needs. The API address in each "
"prompt comes from the detail page of its data task. After submissions are"
" made, use GET to retrieve data from the API address (see Section 4)."

msgid "普通数据提交"
msgstr "Normal Data Submission"

msgid "适用场景：投票、答题、签到、问卷"
msgstr "Use cases: polls, quizzes, check-ins, surveys"

msgid ""
"学生提交姓名、选项、得分等<strong>纯文本/数字</strong>字段，后端原样存储。这是最简单、最常用的写法：告诉 AI 用 POST "
"方式把 JSON 数据发到任务的 API 地址即可。"
msgstr ""
"Students submit <strong>plain text/number</strong> fields such as name, "
"choices, and scores; the backend stores them as-is. This is the simplest "
"and most common style: tell the AI to POST JSON to the task API address."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "要点：字段名可自定义；提交成功会返回 {\"message\": \"提交成功\", \"status\": \"success\"}。"
msgstr ""
"Tip: field names are customizable; a successful submission returns "
"{\"message\": \"提交成功\", \"status\": \"success\"}."

msgid "多模态数据提交（含文件上传）"
msgstr "Multimodal Data Submission (with File Upload)"

msgid "适用场景：作品提交、语音作业、图片收集"
msgstr "Use cases: artwork submission, voice assignments, image collection"

msgid ""
"学生上传<strong>图片、音频、视频、文档</strong>等文件，可与文本字段混合提交。用 <code>multipart/form-"
"data</code> 格式，文件放在 file 字段；保存后的访问路径会写入返回数据的 <code>attachment</code> 字段。"
msgstr ""
"Students upload <strong>images, audio, video, documents</strong> and "
"other files, which can be mixed with text fields. Use <code>multipart"
"/form-data</code> format; place the file in the <code>file</code> field. "
"The saved access path will be written to the <code>attachment</code> "
"field of the response."

msgid "要点：不要手动设置 Content-Type，浏览器会自动带上文件边界；多文件可重复 append。"
msgstr ""
"Tip: do not set Content-Type manually — the browser adds the file "
"boundary automatically. For multiple files, call append repeatedly."

