msgstr "Real-time Interactive Data Submission"

msgid "适用场景：课堂抢答、实时投票、数据大屏"
msgstr "Use cases: classroom buzzer polls, live voting, data dashboards"

msgid ""
"学生端照常 POST 提交；<strong>教师端/大屏页面用原生 WebSocket 订阅</strong>——每条新提交实时推送一条 "
"JSON，无需轮询。告诉 AI 两个地址即可：提交地址（POST）和订阅地址（WebSocket）。"
msgstr ""
"Students still submit via POST; the <strong>teacher/dashboard page "
"subscribes with native WebSocket</strong> — each new submission is pushed"
" as JSON in real time, no polling needed. Give the AI two addresses: the "
"POST URL and the WebSocket URL."

