msgstr ""
"Tip: derive the WebSocket URL by replacing <code>http://</code> with "
"<code>ws://</code> (or <code>https://</code> with <code>wss://</code>) "
"and <code>/api/</code> with <code>/ws/</code>."

msgid "数据获取（GET 查询）"
msgstr "Data Retrieval (GET Query)"

msgid "适用场景：查看提交结果、教师端数据展示、轮询获取数据"
msgstr "Use cases: viewing submission results, teacher-side data display, polling"

msgid ""
"提交数据用 POST，取回数据更简单——<strong>用 GET 方式访问任务的 API "
"地址即可</strong>，无需登录、无需密钥，浏览器直接打开就能查看。同一个地址加不加 "
"<code>/all</code>，区别在于返回的数据量："
msgstr ""
"Use POST to submit; retrieval is even simpler — <strong>just GET the task"
" API address</strong>. No login, no API key, open it directly in a "
"browser. The difference between adding <code>/all</code> and not is how "
"much data comes back:"

